## Cheapest Flight from DEL to BOM
### Departure Details

* Date: 2025-06-20
* Time: 16:50 (DEL)

### Arrival Details

* Destination: BOM (T2)
* Time: 19:05 (BOM)

### Flight Information

* Airline: Air India
* Flight Number: AI 2941
* Duration: 2h 15m
* Stops: Direct
* Connecting Airports: N/A

### Price and Baggage Details

* Price (INR): ₹7,545
* Base Price: ₹6,559.00
* Taxes & Fees: ₹986
* Branded Fare: ECO VALUE
* Baggage Allowance: 15kg checked + 7kg cabin
```

